Package: ominull-hub
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: systemd
Maintainer: Ominull Project <secops@example.invalid>
Description: Ominull fleet management hub
 The hub stores telemetry, policy, identity, and release state for Ominull
 endpoints. Persistent database and PKI data remain outside the package.
